  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Candia, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \n     About   \t\t\t \n     Contact  \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Motor Vehicles \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Bill of Sale \r\n\t\t\t DMV Fees & Forms \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t\t Explanation of SB2 \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Town & School Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t State Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Supervisor of the Checklist \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nOverview \nThe Mission of the Town Clerk's Office is to provide competency, consistency, and equality of services to all customers regardless of the uniqueness of the situation, in a friendly and caring manner. \nWhat We Do \nThe Town Clerk's Responsibilities and Services include (but not limited to) \nMotor Vehicle Registrations (passenger plates, vanity plates, tractor trailer, motorcycle, agriculture, farm, conservation plates, veteran, and antique plates) \nOther DMV (Department of Motor Vehicle) services \nTitles \nDuplicate Registration and Stickers \nReplacement Plates \nDog Licenses \nMarriage Licenses \nCertified copies of Vital Records - Births, Marriages and Deaths \nIssuing certified copies of any records held by the Town Clerks Office \nKeeper and Preserver of Town & Board Meeting minutes \nAdminister Oaths of Office \nWork as an election official whose duties include registering citizens to vote, issuing absentee ballots, officiating at elections, filing election returns, and support the preservation of the checklist used at elections \nPrepare Financial and Vital Records Reports for the Town Report \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\tTracey Boucher\r\nTown Clerk / Notary \r\n\t\t\tTami Baker\r\nDeputy Town Clerk / Notary \r\nTown Clerk's Office \r\nEmail Town Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Candia Town Offices \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 74 High Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Candia ,  NH   03034 \r\nPhone:  603-483-5573 \r\nFax: 603-483-0252 \r\nOffice Hours \nMonday & Tuesday: 4 pm to 7 pm \nWednesday & Thursday: 8:30 am to 1:30 pm \nFriday: Closed \nClosures of the Town Clerk's office due to inclement weather will be announced on WMUR (Channel 9) and WZID (95.7 FM). \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Directory \r\n\t\t\t Calendar \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Elections & Voting \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\nTown of Candia \r\nCandia Town Offices \r\n74 High Street \r\nCandia, NH 03034 \r\nPhone:  603-483-8101  |  Email \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
